{%- comment -%}
  A tiny JSON view of a collection's storefront filters:
    /collections/wheels?view=facets

  Why this exists: only a collection page has `collection.filters`, so any OTHER
  surface that wants to offer spec dropdowns — the homepage hero's wheel search,
  a landing page — has no way to learn the real option values. The alternative
  is to copy the catalogue's values into that surface, which is exactly how the
  homepage's hardcoded centre-bore list rotted until it hid ~1,100 of ~1,400
  wheels. This keeps one source: Shopify's own facet index.

  Shape:
    { "handle": "wheels", "count": 2061,
      "filters": [ { "param": "filter.p.m.custom.rim_diameter",
                     "label": "Rim diameter",
                     "values": [ { "v": "20", "n": 627 }, … ] }, … ] }

  "val" (added 2026-11-15) is the exact value to send back as the filter
  param. It differs from the label for a grouped value: "All Season" is a
  FilterSettingGroup whose value is a gid, and only that value checks the box
  and shows the chip on the results page. The home hero's quick filters use it.

  Only value-list filters are emitted; price ranges and the like are skipped,
  since a dropdown can't use them. Values keep Shopify's own strings so they can
  be handed straight back as filter params.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- layout none -%}
{%- capture body -%}
{
  "handle": {{ collection.handle | json }},
  "title": {{ collection.title | json }},
  "count": {{ collection.all_products_count }},
  "filters": [
    {%- assign emitted = 0 -%}
    {%- for f in collection.filters -%}
      {%- if f.type == 'list' and f.values.size > 0 -%}
        {%- if emitted > 0 -%},{%- endif -%}
        {
          "param": {{ f.param_name | json }},
          "label": {{ f.label | json }},
          "values": [
            {%- for v in f.values -%}
              {"v": {{ v.label | json }}, "n": {{ v.count }}, "val": {{ v.value | json }}}{%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          ]
        }
        {%- assign emitted = emitted | plus: 1 -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  ]
}
{%- endcapture -%}
{{- body | strip -}}
